Kafka transactions make consume, then process, then produce atomic within Kafka.

1083
01:15:38.317 --> 01:15:46.915
Neither covers side effects in your database or other systems, application-level double publishes, or reprocessing after an offset reset.

1084
01:15:47.195 --> 01:15:50.181
The consumer's effect must be idempotent on its own.

